did you catch that unscripted scarlet  witch moment in doctor strange in the  multiverse of madness keep watching to  find out what went down on set and why  elizabeth olsen said she did not enjoy  it at all olsen scarlet witch has  entered a bit of a dark phase in her mcu  character arc after losing vision to the  infinity war capping struggle against  thanos and the grueling meditation on  grief that was one division she has  achieved full villain status in doctor  strange in the multiverse of madness in  some sense this iteration is a return to  form for the sokovian witch as longtime  fans will surely remember she began her  mcu journey as a dangerous hydra  experiment in the mid credits scene in  captain america the winter soldier that  version of wanda had completed a full  redemption arc by the time infinity war  rolled around but after the collapse of  her idyllic hex around westview new  jersey she's arguably more dangerous  than ever before so it's perhaps  unsurprising that the actress behind  scarlet witch had trouble filming some  of her darker scenes in horror maestro  sam raimi's doctor strange sequel for  olson the issue was organic to the  script and things got the darkest when  she was working with two of her youngest  co-stars as the old saying goes every  villain thinks they're the hero of their  own story the same is true for wanda as  she goes down her dark path in the film  with her scarlet witch powers waxing she  becomes obsessed with seeing her family  again but once she crosses over into  earth 838 reunites with them and gets  pelted in the face for her trouble she  starts screaming an angry mom voice at  her boys according to a recent interview  with variety olson admits that while  filming she got smacked in the face  really hard with a prop that the child  actors opposite her and the scene were  throwing it wasn't planned but the  ensuing reaction that injury drew out of  olsen made the scene all the more  intense olsen told variety one of the  people that i love the little people  that i love they were throwing things at  me in the scene and accidentally smacked  my face really hard and that was the  best reaction and i felt so bad that i  used it as the actor and let it inform  how i responded to these people that i  love because they were terrified after  it really was something i did not enjoy  at all but i knew it'd be good for the  scene for any actor playing a character  like wanda maximoff is a major challenge  because of all the twists and turns in  her story before doctor strange 2 olsen  had already taken wanda through one  entire redemption arc coming on the  heels of wand division wanda is back in  full blown villain mode for olson some  of wanda's actions in doctor strange 2  are disturbing and she had a difficult  time reconciling them with the character  she thought she knew in the film wanda  is determined to create a universe where  her two boys exist but this comes at the  cost of having to destroy america chavez  a teenage girl with the ability to  travel through multiverses we found a  girl who can somehow travel across it  but she's being pursued received by him  some kind of demon one of the covets her  power for itself not only is wanda  willing to send demons after a teenager  but when dr strange and his fellow  wizards try to stop her things get  violent wanda wipes out several of  doctor strange's fellow wizards plus an  entire superhero team called the  illuminati which includes alternate  earth versions of dr charles xavier and  captain carter olsen was troubled when  she found out her character was willing  to eliminate anyone who got in her way  in order to deliver her performance she  had to get into the right mindset olson  explained to variety i just had to  buckle down and think all these people  are in her way and she's warned doctor  strange not to get in her way and he did  he didn't listen and so i just had to go  from that point of view wanda's heel  turn might be familiar to comics readers  but it's still unsettling especially for  olsen check out one of our newest videos  right here plus even more looper videos  about doctor strange and the multiverse  of madness are coming soon subscribe to  our youtube channel and hit the bell so  you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

